{"id":"1516012f95b8e7cd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-first-order-semantics.md","title":"First-Order Structures, Evaluation and Satisfaction","display":"df-first-order-semantics — First-Order Structures, Evaluation and Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-first-order-semantics","aliases":["89-df-first-order-semantics"],"display":"df-first-order-semantics — First-Order Structures, Evaluation and Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-first-order-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-first-order-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-semantics — First-Order Structures, Evaluation and Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a> 的一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span> 为其变量集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 使用该文件的自由生成语法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(D,I_C,I_F,I_P)\">\\(\\mathcal M=(D,I_C,I_F,I_P)\\)</span> 为候选结构，四个分量都是集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 由下式给出。求值及满足关系仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> 下定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^{\\mathsf V}\">\\(s\\in D^{\\mathsf V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in P\">\\(R\\in P\\)</span>；应用中的项列长度分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(f)\">\\(a_F(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_P(R)\">\\(a_P(R)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^k\">\\(D^k\\)</span> 为以有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 为域的赋值序列集合，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(D^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；二元关系图仍使用 Kuratowski 有序对。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是此处定义的元层满足关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{tv}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathsf{tv}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 特征值；两者不是添加到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的对象语言符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\land I_C:C\\to D\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(I_F)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I_F)=F\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(I_P)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I_P)=P\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F\\ (I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D)\n\\land\\forall R\\in P\\ (I_P(R)\\subseteq D^{a_P(R)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(x,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(x),\\quad\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(c,s)\\coloneqq I_C(c),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(f(\\vec t),s)&amp;\\coloneqq\nI_F(f)(\\langle\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t_i,s)\\mid i&lt;a_F(f)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(\\vec t,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t_i,s)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t,s)=\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}R(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(\\vec t,s)\\in I_P(R),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A\\lor B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A)\\lor(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}B),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\forall xA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ (\\mathcal M,s[x\\mapsto d]\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{tv}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(A,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}S&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in D^{\\mathsf V}\\ (\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}S)\n\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nD\\ne\\varnothing\\land I_C:C\\to D\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(I_F)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I_F)=F\\land\n\\operatorname{Function}(I_P)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(I_P)=P\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F\\ (I_F(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D)\n\\land\\forall R\\in P\\ (I_P(R)\\subseteq D^{a_P(R)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(x,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(x),\\quad\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(c,s)\\coloneqq I_C(c),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(f(\\vec t),s)&amp;\\coloneqq\nI_F(f)(\\langle\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t_i,s)\\mid i&lt;a_F(f)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(\\vec t,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t_i,s)\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(t,s)=\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}R(\\vec t)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{val}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(\\vec t,s)\\in I_P(R),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A\\lor B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A)\\lor(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}B),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\forall xA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ (\\mathcal M,s[x\\mapsto d]\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\\\\n\\mathsf{tv}_{\\mathcal L}^{\\mathcal M}(A,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A,\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg(\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}A),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\models_{\\mathcal L}S&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in D^{\\mathsf V}\\ (\\mathcal M,s\\models_{\\mathcal L}S)\n\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项求值按项树递归，满足关系按公式树递归。零元函数与零元关系的参数列均为空序列。该接口补齐数值定义子句实际调用的通用一阶语义；不替换 PA 的专用标准模型真值接口，不引入 PA 或集合论内部的全局真谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)$ 为 [[89-df-first-order-formula]] 的一阶签名，$\\mathsf V$ 为其变量集；$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)$ 使用该文件的自由生成语法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(D,I_C,I_F,I_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FOModel}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^{\\